  "details": "I don't like the group notifications that say.\n\n\"Instance is up!\" \n\n\"Posted [6 days ago]\"\n\nPut a settings icon at the top left that lets me \n\n-mute all messages (do not disturb)\n\n-set mute duration\n\n-Mute individual group (may be synonymous with \"unsubscribe\" which sounds like a more permanent word)\n\n-select group and only show messages from selected groups checkbox style\n\n-mark all messages as read\n\n-mark all group messages as read\n\n-leave group (right from the menu)\n\n-clear messages from group after {duration}\n\n-clear messages from all groups after {duration}",
